---
import Section from '../common/Section.astro';
import EventMarquee from './EventMarquee.astro';
---
<Section>
  <p class="font-display font-light text-lead text-ink">An <span class="text-brand">unconference</span> is a gathering <b class="font-bold">for attendees, by attendees</b>. A few talks open the day. After that there is no schedule, not until the sessions go up on <b class="font-bold">one big physical timetable</b> and the room decides where to be.</p>

  <figure>
    <EventMarquee />
    <figcaption class="font-body text-[12px] text-faint mt-3">The board at BarCamp Kathmandu 2024, and the rooms it filled. Every slot taken by whoever turned up.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</Section>
